@host = http://localhost:5100

### What the register holds
GET {{host}}/installations

### A notification to everyone
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "alert",
  "title": "Resultat klara",
  "body": "Ett meddelande fran sample-servern",
  "route": "log",
  "highPriority": true
}

### A notification to one tag expression
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "alert",
  "targetKind": "tags",
  "target": "kind:news && !team:blue",
  "title": "Bara till nyhetsprenumeranter",
  "body": "team:blue ar undantagna"
}

### A silent message; nothing is shown, the handler runs
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "silent",
  "data": { "sync": "everything" }
}

### Rebuild the widgets
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "widget",
  "widgetKind": "sample"
}

### Update the Live Activity
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "liveactivity",
  "activityKind": "sample",
  "title": "Uppdaterad fran servern",
  "body": "Innehallet kommer utifran"
}
